The game is incredible at many points :
1 - The community is really nice , some players develop awesome techniques and playstyles,wich makes the game infinite ;
2 - There are over 2 thousand gamemodes (NOT counting the ones posted on the forum , made by the community , once again being mentioned) ;
3 - You can play the game just to spend some time , you can play the game as a competitive player and you can play the game with the objective of creating replays ;
4 - There are many replay types : self-spar , ukebashing , parkour , tricking , replay hacking , etc...you will eventually learn what each of them is , if you play the game with the objective of learning ;
5 - The replay hacking i mentioned before , is just something unique , it allows you to do whatever you want to do , i've seen players giving blocks life and transforming these same blocks in a stone golem , then fighting it , that is just one of the various incredible things you can do with replay hacking ;
6 - Now , lets talk about the Tori (the doll you control) customization , there is a gigantic amount of ways to customize your Tori , you can change textures , you can change models , you can change colors , you can add trails , you can add flames , you can add hairs and a ton more , but , the developer needs to get money somehow , so there is an option for you to buy the ingame currency (toricredits,tc) with real money or/and you can still earn it by playing , by making textures for others and getting paid , by making clan logos for others and getting paid , for making videos about others and getting paid , participating events (events are very common , the event squad is always creating new events) , in conclusion ,  it's really not hard to get toricredits .
Overall , i'd say the game is perfect .
